    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SUKIE: Huge!\nJANE: No. Small. Really, I prefer small. Aesthetically. And huge can be a problem. Sam was huge and there were days I just couldn't face it.\nALEX: I'm sort of in the middle. But honestly, what's the difference, as long as it works...",
      "SUKIE: Right again. Listen, I have to run. I'll see you tonight.\nALEX: Yeah. I have to get to the shop. See you later.\nSUKIE: 'Bye.\nFELICIA: That house is a landmark building. They had no right to sell it.",
      "SUKIE: Alex? Yoo-hoo!\nALEX: I'm out here.\nSUKIE: What in the world...?\nALEX: Come on, we're going to be late. Carol? The kids are here.",
      "SUKIE: Jane...? Is that you?\nJANE: Yes. Hello, Alex. Did you come to fix the plumbing?\nALEX: I didn't have time to change. What's your excuse?\nJANE: No excuse. I was invited here.",
      "ALEX: Hi! Are we late?\nJANE: I thought we were playing singles."
    ]
  },
